1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:03,210
"Sir, one point…" Riya
raised her hand. The VP:

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:05,765
"Let the experienced people talk."

3
00:00:06,145 --> 00:00:07,405
Judged for your age…

4
00:00:07,405 --> 00:00:09,660
they only saw 'junior'.

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:12,620
In the Mahabharata, at King
Janaka's gate…

6
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,429
a ten-year-old boy was stopped.

7
00:00:14,429 --> 00:00:17,298
The gatekeeper: "Boys
don't enter here."

8
00:00:17,298 --> 00:00:19,433
The same line Riya heard.

9
00:00:19,503 --> 00:00:22,706
The boy was Ashtavakra. He said —

10
00:00:22,876 --> 00:00:27,428
Grey hair doesn't make an elder. A
child who truly knows,

11
00:00:27,428 --> 00:00:29,761
the gods call the elder.

12
00:00:30,131 --> 00:00:35,067
Not years, grey hair or money. The
elder is the one who knows.

13
00:00:35,137 --> 00:00:38,428
And he beat the court's top
scholar in debate.

14
00:00:38,648 --> 00:00:42,857
Next meeting, Riya didn't ask. She
showed the data.

15
00:00:43,027 --> 00:00:46,132
Team speak-up or team
stay-quiet? Comment below.
